A04-maximized-window
A90-unmaximise-joins-pair-forming-left
A91-unmaximise-parks-when-no-neighbour-can-pair
# --- float / above-floats ---
A11-float-toggle
A61-above-floats
# --- minimize / reap ---
A35-minimize-removes-workspace
# --- lone-window maximize ---
A58-lone-window-maximized
