A96-reorder-is-honoured-and-an-empty-workspace-is-pruned
A117-arrival-side-rule
A72-sticky-window-untiled
# --- overview ---
A56-coherence-sweep
A74-overview-drop-is-a-move
# --- registry / identity ---
A98-registry-lists-every-app
# --- displays ---
